# Pinned third-party media sources for Tier 1 decode (FFmpeg 5.1 ABI + Opus).
#
# These pins are load-bearing for two reasons:
#   1. ABI: the client binds libavcodec 59 / libavutil 57 and libopus sonames.
#      Any other FFmpeg major is rejected at preflight.
#   2. LAW: only LGPL-configured FFmpeg may be bundled into our packages.
#      The build scripts below pass --disable-gpl --disable-nonfree
#      --disable-version3 explicitly, and record the full configure line in
#      every output's BUILD-INFO.txt. A GPL ("full") prebuilt shared FFmpeg
#      (e.g. Gyan full_build-shared, which bundles x264/x265) MUST NOT be
#      substituted here: bundling GPL binaries would attach copyleft to our
#      distribution. See deploy/docs/display-tiers.md#redistribution.
#
# Format: <name> <version> <url> <sha256>
